(5016389, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '<center><font color=''#FF8000''>Ascension</font></center>
<center><font color=''#00FF00''>III</font></center><font color=''#FFFFFF''>Radiance applies an aegis effect on those hit, this aegis increases protection against unholy damage from NPCs.
Smite VI has a chance to apply a finesse hit, this finesse hit will provide a Celestial Boon buff. The Celestial Boon buff increases the priest''s heal rating but will be consumed when next casting Wave of Life, doing so adds a received healing buff to those hit.<center><font color=''#00FF00''>V</font></center>The duration of the unholy aegis effect applied by Radiance is increased.
The strength of the heal rating on Celestial Boon is increased as is the duration of the received healing buff when consuming it with Wave of Life.<center><font color=''#00FF00''>VIII</font></center>The duration of the unholy aegis effect applied by Radiance is increased further.
The strength of the heal rating on Celestial Boon is further increased as is the duration of the received healing buff when consuming it with Wave of Life.
The bonus critical healing chance from Radiance is increased.</font>', 0, 0, 0, 6000000, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, FALSE, 'Ascension VIII', 10, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, FALSE, NULL, NULL, NULL),
