(5016452, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '<center><font color=''#FF8000''>Furious Swipe</font></center>
<center><font color=''#00FF00''>III</font></center><font color=''#FFFFFF''>Fierce Recovery applies an aegis effect on those hit, this aegis increases protection against poison damage from NPCs.
Shrewd Blow VI has a chance to apply a finesse hit, this finesse hit will provide a Celestial Boon buff. The Celestial Boon buff increases the priest''s heal rating but will be consumed when next casting Blood Flow, doing so adds a physical life tap buff to those hit.
<center><font color=''#00FF00''>V</font></center>The duration of the poison aegis effect applied by Fierce Recovery is increased.
The strength of the heal rating on Celestial Boon is increased as is the duration of the life tap buff when consuming it with Blood Flow.
<center><font color=''#00FF00''>VIII</font></center>The duration of the poison aegis effect applied by Fierce Recovery is increased further.
The strength of the heal rating on Celestial Boon is further increased as is the duration of the life tap buff when consuming it with Blood Flow.
The bonus critical healing chance from Fierce Recovery is increased.</font>', 0, 0, 0, 6000000, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, FALSE, 'Furious Swipe VIII', 10, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, FALSE, NULL, NULL, NULL),
