', 0, 0, 0, 6000000, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, FALSE, 'Silent Slayer', 10, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, FALSE, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(5054880, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '<center><font color=''#FF8000''>The First Circle </font></center> <font color=''#FFFFFF''>The Fires of Gehenna (Rank 6) spell has a chance to apply an additional maximized finesse hit while Cursed by Hell is active. The Shockstrike (Rank 6) spell has a chance to apply an additional maximized finesse hit while Cursed by the Heavens is active. All direct damage demonic servant spells have a chance of applying an additional wildfire finesse hit. Summoning any demon will now summon an additional demon, the Abyssal Flameweaver, who will follow your commands and allow for a more powerful version of the demon team buffs to run.
', 0, 0, 0, 6000000, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, FALSE, 'The First Circle', 10, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, FALSE, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(5054881, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '<center><font color=''#FF8000''>Ascension</font></center> <font color=''#FFFFFF''>Radiance applies a maximized aegis effect on those hit, this aegis increases protection against unholy damage from NPCs. Smite VI has a chance to apply a maximized finesse hit, this finesse hit will provide a Celestial Boon buff. The Celestial Boon buff increases the priest''s heal rating but will be consumed when next casting Wave of Life, doing so adds a received healing buff to those hit. The bonus critical healing chance from Radiance is increased.</font>', 0, 0, 0, 6000000, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, FALSE, 'Ascension', 10, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, FALSE, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(5054882, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '<center><font color=''#FF8000''>Judgment Bolt</font></center> <font color=''#FFFFFF''>Vitalizing Jolt applies a maximized aegis effect on those hit, this aegis increases protection against fire damage from NPCs. Charged Blast has a chance to apply a maximized finesse hit, this finesse hit will provide a Celestial Boon buff. The Celestial Boon buff increases the priest''s heal rating but will be consumed when next casting Life of Set, doing so adds a protection affect to those hit. The bonus critical healing chance from Vitalizing Jolt is increased.', 0, 0, 0, 6000000, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, FALSE, 'Judgment Bolt', 10, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, FALSE, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(5054883, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '<center><font color=''#FF8000''>Berserker''s Fury </font></center> <font color=''#FFFFFF''> The Bone Shatter, Jagged Cut IV and Staggering Blow IV combos have a chance to apply an additional maximized finesse hit and additionally applying a secondary, relevant debuff or DoT depending on which combo was used. Duration of Reaver Stance is increased.', 0, 0, 0, 6000000, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, FALSE, 'Berserker''s Fury', 10, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, FALSE, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(5054884, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '<center><font color=''#FF8000''>Quilled Darts </font></center> <font color=''#FFFFFF''> The Quick Shot V, Clout and Penetrating Shot V combos have a chance to apply an additional maximized finesse hit. Duration of Advantage: Focused Fire is increased.', 0, 0, 0, 6000000, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, FALSE, 'Quilled Darts', 10, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, FALSE, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(5054885, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '<center><font color=''#FF8000''>Furious Swipe</font></center> <font color=''#FFFFFF''>Fierce Recovery applies a maximized aegis effect on those hit, this aegis increases protection against poison damage from NPCs. Shrewd Blow VI has a chance to apply a finesse hit, this finesse hit will provide a maximized  Celestial Boon buff. The Celestial Boon buff increases the priest''s heal rating but will be consumed when next casting Blood Flow, doing so adds a physical life tap buff to those hit. The bonus critical healing chance from Fierce Recovery is increased.', 0, 0, 0, 6000000, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, FALSE, 'Furious Swipe', 10, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, FALSE, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(5054886, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '<center><font color=''#FF8000''>Chaos Agent</font></center> <font color=''#FFFFFF''>Unhallowed Blight IV applies one of several maximized finesse buffs based on which Covenant is running. The soldier''s critigation amount is increased.', 0, 0, 0, 6000000, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, FALSE, 'Chaos Agent', 10, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, FALSE, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(5054887, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '<center><font color=''#FF8000''>Proven Champion</font></center> <font color=''#FFFFFF''>Guard of Dancing Steel IV and the respective Rout apply a finesse hit buffing the Conqueror with a maximized effect based on their current Formation. Breach IV and the respective Rout apply a finesse hit buffing the Conqueror with a maximized effect based on their current Discipline. The soldier''s critigation amount is increased.</font>
', 0, 0, 0, 6000000, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, FALSE, 'Proven Champion', 10, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, FALSE, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(5054888, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '<center><font color=''#FF8000''>Tireless Defender</font></center> <font color=''#FFFFFF''>Counterstike IV and the respective Deliberate Reprisal apply a finesse hit buffing the Guardian with a maximized effect based on their current Tactic. Guard V and the respective Deliberate Reprisal apply a finesse hit buffing the Guardian with a maximized effect based on their current Maneuver. The soldier''s critigation amount is increased.', 0, 0, 0, 6000000, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, FALSE, 'Tireless Defender', 10, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, FALSE, NULL, NULL, NULL),
