(5055666, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'The Fires of Gehenna (Rank 6) spell has a chance to apply an additional finesse hit while Cursed by Hell is active. The Shockstrike (Rank 6) spell has a chance to apply an additional finesse hit while Cursed by the Heavens is active. All direct damage demonic servant spells have a chance of applying an additional wildfire finesse hit. ', 0, 0, 0, 6000000, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, FALSE, 'The First Circle V', 10, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, FALSE, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(5055667, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '<center><font color=''#FF8000''>Quilled Darts </font></center> <font color=''#FFFFFF''> The Quick Shot V, Clout and Penetrating Shot V combos have a chance to apply an additional finesse hit.', 0, 0, 0, 6000000, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, FALSE, 'Quilled Darts V', 10, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, FALSE, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(5055668, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '<center><font color=''#FF8000''>Furious Swipe</font></center> <font color=''#FFFFFF''>Fierce Recovery applies an aegis effect on those hit, this aegis increases protection against poison damage from NPCs. Shrewd Blow VI has a chance to apply a finesse hit, this finesse hit will provide a  Celestial Boon buff. The Celestial Boon buff increases the priest''s heal rating but will be consumed when next casting Blood Flow, doing so adds a physical life tap buff to those hit.', 0, 0, 0, 6000000, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, FALSE, 'Furious Swipe V', 10, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, FALSE, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(5055669, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 6000000, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, FALSE, 'Unholy Communion V', 10, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, FALSE, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(5055670, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '<center><font color=''#FF8000''>Chaos Agent</font></center> <font color=''#FFFFFF''>Unhallowed Blight IV applies one of several finesse buffs based on which Covenant is running.', 0, 0, 0, 6000000, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, FALSE, 'Chaos Agent V', 10, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, FALSE, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(5055671, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '<center><font color=''#FF8000''>Ascension</font></center> <font color=''#FFFFFF''>Radiance applies an aegis effect on those hit, this aegis increases protection against unholy damage from NPCs. Smite VI has a chance to apply a finesse hit, this finesse hit will provide a Celestial Boon buff. The Celestial Boon buff increases the priest''s heal rating but will be consumed when next casting Wave of Life, doing so adds a received healing buff to those hit.</font>', 0, 0, 0, 6000000, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, FALSE, 'Ascension V', 10, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, FALSE, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(5055672, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 'Duration of the Pestilential Blast is increased. The Ice Strike (Rank 6) spell has a chance to apply an additional finesse hit.', 0, 0, 0, 6000000, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, FALSE, 'Unholy Communion V', 10, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, FALSE, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(5055673, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '<center><font color=''#FF8000''>Silent Slayer </font></center> <font color=''#FFFFFF''> The Slow Death Strike V and Grim Corruption V combos have a chance to apply an additional maximized finesse hits.', 0, 0, 0, 6000000, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, FALSE, 'Silent Slayer V', 10, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, FALSE, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(5055674, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '<center><font color=''#FF8000''>Judgment Bolt</font></center> <font color=''#FFFFFF''>Vitalizing Jolt applies an aegis effect on those hit, this aegis increases protection against fire damage from NPCs. Charged Blast has a chance to apply a finesse hit, this finesse hit will provide a Celestial Boon buff. The Celestial Boon buff increases the priest''s heal rating but will be consumed when next casting Life of Set, doing so adds a protection affect to those hit.', 0, 0, 0, 6000000, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, FALSE, 'Judgment Bolt V', 10, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, FALSE, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(5055675, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '<center><font color=''#FF8000''>Tireless Defender</font></center> <font color=''#FFFFFF''>Counterstike IV and the respective Deliberate Reprisal apply a finesse hit buffing the Guardian with an effect based on their current Tactic. Guard V and the respective Deliberate Reprisal apply a finesse hit buffing the Guardian with an effect based on their current Maneuver.', 0, 0, 0, 6000000, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, FALSE, 'Tireless Defender V', 10, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, FALSE, NULL, NULL, NULL),
