This Asp Ring will protect you from the Citadel''s deadly wards. Cut Leviathus free from this earthly realm. Slay Thoth-Amon and release me from his accursed sorcery.

Thoth-Amon suspects my betrayal and intends to sear my flesh with the Mark of Acheron to ensure my obedience. A dead soul of Acheron will coldly occupy my mortal shell; you should appreciate this hellish fate.

If there is no glimmer of recognition or light of human life in my eye, strike me down and destroy the dead soul that torments me; better oblivion than cold undeath. 
